cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "forest-fire-model: a fast, tested Drossel–Schwabl forest-fire model"
abstract: >-
  A vectorised implementation of the Drossel–Schwabl forest-fire model, with stepwise and
  instantaneous (time-scale-separated) simulation modes and a discrete maximum-likelihood
  fit of the fire-size power law.
authors:
  - family-names: Reginiano
    given-names: Michael
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-23
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mikereg/forest-fire-model"
keywords:
  - cellular automata
  - self-organized criticality
  - forest-fire model
  - power law
  - maximum likelihood
